<title>HONG KONG: Sharp Brave to change name to Billion.</title>
<headline>Sharp Brave to change name to Billion.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic concern Sharp Brave Holdings Ltd proposed changing its name to Billion International Holdings Ltd to reflect the change in control of the company, Sharp Brave said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sharp Brave said the name change was subject to shareholders approval in a special general meeting.</p>
<p>In December, private firm Ming Kee Investments Ltd agreed to buy a 71.30 percent stake in Sharp Brave from the company's parent Leung Kee Holdings Ltd for HK$73.28 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
